---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact & customer care | Norella">
  <section class="section-shell"><p class="eyebrow">HERE TO HELP</p><h1 class="text-4xl mt-3">A more personal touch.</h1><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">From finding your favourite piece to planning a special occasion, a little guidance makes all the difference.</p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-12"><div><h2 class="text-2xl mb-4">Collection enquiries</h2><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Our online boutique is being prepared. Contact details and appointment booking will be available when we launch.</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-4">For now, explore the sample collection and save pieces to your shopping bag on this device.</p><a href="/shop" class="primary-link mt-6">Explore the collection ↗</a></div><div id="delivery" class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl mb-5">Good to know</h2><details class="bg-white border border-[#e5ded3] p-5" open><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">Delivery estimates</summary><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">The sample checkout estimates Rs. 750 for delivery within Sri Lanka, with complimentary delivery on orders of Rs. 15,000 or more. Delivery timing will be confirmed when ordering opens.</p></details><details class="bg-white border border-[#e5ded3] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">Returns & exchanges</summary><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">Our returns and exchange policy will be published before purchases are enabled.</p></details><details class="bg-white border border-[#e5ded3] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">About the sample collection</summary><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">Products and prices are examples. Collection photographs may be shared across sample pieces. Final specifications, availability and imagery will be confirmed at launch.</p></details><details class="bg-white border border-[#e5ded3] p-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">Your saved shopping bag</summary><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">Your bag is stored in this browser. You can remove individual pieces or clear it at any time. Adding a piece does not reserve stock or place an order.</p></details></div></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
